#: edit.cpp:112
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<p>Specifies the phone numbers to dial. You\n"
"can supply multiple numbers here, simply\n"
"click on \"Add\". You can arrange the\n"
"order the numbers are tried by using the\n"
"arrow buttons.\n"
"\n"
"When a number is busy or fails, <i>kppp</i> will \n"
"try the next number and so on"
msgstr ""
"<p>指定要撥接的電話號碼。您\n"
"可以在這裡提供多組號碼，只須\n"
"按下「新增」即可。您可以利用\n"
"方向按鈕來安排各號碼的撥打順\n"
"序。\n"
"\n"
"當某一號碼忙線或撥打失敗時，\n"
"<i>kppp</i> 會接著試撥下一\n"
"組號碼"

#: edit.cpp:123
#, kde-format
msgid "A&uthentication:"
msgstr "認證(&U):"

#: edit.cpp:128
#, kde-format
msgid "Script-based"
msgstr "Script 式"

#: edit.cpp:129
#, kde-format
msgid "PAP"
msgstr "PAP"

#: edit.cpp:130
#, kde-format
msgid "Terminal-based"
msgstr "終端機式"

#: edit.cpp:131
#, kde-format
msgid "CHAP"
msgstr "CHAP"

#: edit.cpp:132
#, kde-format
msgid "PAP/CHAP"
msgstr "PAP/CHAP"

#: edit.cpp:134
#, fuzzy, kde-format
#| msgid ""
#| "<p>Specifies the method used to identify yourself to\n"
#| "the PPP server. Most universities still use\n"
#| "<b>Terminal</b>- or <b>Script</b>-based authentication,\n"
#| "while most ISP use <b>PAP</b> and/or <b>CHAP</b>. If\n"
#| "unsure, contact your ISP.\n"
#| "\n"
#| "If you can choose between PAP and CHAP,\n"
#| "choose CHAP, because it's much safer. If you don't know\n"
#| "whether PAP or CHAP is right, choose PAP/CHAP."
msgid ""
"<p>Specifies the method used to identify yourself to\n"
"the PPP server. Most universities still use\n"
"<b>Terminal</b>- or <b>Script</b>-based authentication,\n"
"while most ISP use <b>PAP</b> and/or <b>CHAP</b>. If\n"
"unsure, contact your ISP.\n"
"\n"
"If you can choose between PAP and CHAP,\n"
"choose CHAP, because it is much safer. If you do not know\n"
"whether PAP or CHAP is right, choose PAP/CHAP."
msgstr ""
"<p>指定用於向 PPP 伺服器表明您識\n"
"別身份的方法。多數大學學校仍是使用\n"
"<b>終端機</b> 或 <b>Script</b> 式\n"
"的驗證方式，而 ISP 則絕大多使用\n"
" <b>PAP</b> 且/或 <b>CHAP</b>。如果\n"
"無法確定，請洽詢您的 ISP。\n"
"\n"
"如果可選擇 PAP 或 CHAP，\n"
"請選擇 CHAP，因為較為安全。如果您不知道\n"
"PAP 或 CHAP 那個好，選擇 PAP/CHAP 。"

#: edit.cpp:147
#, kde-format
msgid "Store &password"
msgstr "儲存密碼(&P)"

#: edit.cpp:151
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<p>When this is turned on, your ISP password\n"
"will be saved in <i>kppp</i>'s config file, so\n"
"you do not need to type it in every time.\n"
"\n"
"<b><font color=\"red\">Warning:</font> your password will be stored as\n"
"plain text in the config file, which is\n"
"readable only to you. Make sure nobody\n"
"gains access to this file!"
msgstr ""
"<p>開啟這個選項時，您的 ISP 密碼\n"
"將會存入 <i>kppp</i> 的設定檔，如此\n"
"您即不須每次都得輸入。\n"
"\n"
"<b><font color=\"red\">警告：</font> 您的密碼將以\n"
"純文字存入設定檔，而且只有\n"
"您可以讀取。請確定他人無法\n"
"存取此檔案！"

#: edit.cpp:160
#, kde-format
msgid "&Callback type:"
msgstr "回撥類型(&C):"

#: edit.cpp:166
#, kde-format
msgid "Administrator-defined"
msgstr "管理員定義的"

#: edit.cpp:167
#, kde-format
msgid "User-defined"
msgstr "用戶定義的"

#: edit.cpp:171
#, kde-format
msgid "Callback type"
msgstr "回撥類型"

#: edit.cpp:176
#, kde-format
msgid "Call&back number:"
msgstr "回撥號碼(&B):"

#: edit.cpp:183
#, kde-format
msgid "Callback phone number"
msgstr "回撥電話號碼"

#: edit.cpp:188
#, kde-format
msgid "Customize &pppd Arguments..."
msgstr "自訂 &pppd 引數..."

#: edit.cpp:331
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Here you can select commands to run at certain stages of the\n"
"connection. The commands are run with your real user id, so\n"
"you cannot run any commands here requiring root permissions\n"
"(unless, of course, you are root).\n"
"\n"
"Be sure to supply the whole path to the program otherwise\n"
"kppp might be unable to find it."
msgstr ""
"您可以在此選擇想在特定連線階段執行的指令。\n"
"該指令會以您的真實使用者識別碼執行，因此\n"
"您將無法在此執行需要 root 權限的任何指令\n"
"(除非您是 root 使用者)。\n"
"\n"
"請務必提供該程式的完整路徑，否則\n"
"kppp 將可能找不到它！"

#: edit.cpp:347
#, kde-format
msgid "&Before connect:"
msgstr "連線前(&B):"

#: edit.cpp:354
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Allows you to run a program <b>before</b> a connection\n"
"is established. It is called immediately before\n"
"dialing has begun.\n"
"\n"
"This might be useful, e.g. to stop HylaFAX blocking the\n"
"modem."
msgstr ""
"允許您在建立連線<b>之前</b>執行\n"
"程式。該程式會在開始撥號前\n"
"被呼叫。\n"
"\n"
"這個選項偶有用處，例如停止 HylaFAX 阻礙\n"
"數據機。"

#: edit.cpp:363
#, kde-format
msgid "&Upon connect:"
msgstr "連線時(&U):"

#: edit.cpp:370
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Allows you to run a program <b>after</b> a connection\n"
"is established. When your program is called, all\n"
"preparations for an Internet connection are finished.\n"
"\n"
"Very useful for fetching mail and news"
msgstr ""
"允許您在建立連線<b>之後</b>執行\n"
"程式。當您的程式被呼叫時，所有\n"
"的互聯網連線準備皆已完成。\n"
"\n"
"對擷取郵件與新聞很有用"

#: edit.cpp:379
#, kde-format
msgid "Before &disconnect:"
msgstr "斷線前(&D):"

#: edit.cpp:387
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Allows you to run a program <b>before</b> a connection\n"
"is closed. The connection will stay open until\n"
"the program exits."
msgstr ""
"允許您在關閉連線<b>之前</b>執行\n"
"程式。連線將保持開啟直到程式\n"
"離開為止。"

#: edit.cpp:394
#, kde-format
msgid "U&pon disconnect:"
msgstr "斷線時(&P):"

#: edit.cpp:403
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Allows you to run a program <b>after</b> a connection\n"
"has been closed."
msgstr ""
"允許您在關閉連線<b>之後</b>執行\n"
"程式。"

#: edit.cpp:448 edit.cpp:808
#, kde-format
msgid "C&onfiguration"
msgstr "設定(&O):"

#: edit.cpp:457
#, kde-format
msgid "Dynamic IP address"
msgstr "動態 IP 位址"

#: edit.cpp:459
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Select this option when your computer gets an\n"
"internet address (IP) every time a\n"
"connection is made.\n"
"\n"
"Almost every Internet Service Provider uses\n"
"this method, so this should be turned on."
msgstr ""
"如果您的電腦是在每次建立連線\n"
"時才取得互聯網位址(IP)，請\n"
"選擇這個選項。\n"
"\n"
"幾乎所有互聯網服務提供者都是\n"
"採用這個方式，因此應該開啟。"

#: edit.cpp:467
#, kde-format
msgid "Static IP address"
msgstr "固定 IP 位址"

#: edit.cpp:471
#, fuzzy, kde-format
#| msgid ""
#| "Select this option when your computer has a\n"
#| "fixed internet address (IP). Most computers\n"
#| "don't have this, so you should probably select\n"
#| "dynamic IP addressing unless you know what you\n"
#| "are doing."
msgid ""
"Select this option when your computer has a\n"
"fixed internet address (IP). Most computers\n"
"do not have one, so you should probably select\n"
"dynamic IP addressing unless you know what you\n"
"are doing."
msgstr ""
"當您的電腦有固定互聯網位址(IP)時，\n"
"請選擇這個選項。大部份的電腦沒有這\n"
"個，所以您除非您知道您在做什麼，\n"
"您應該選擇動態 IP 位址。"

#: edit.cpp:481
#, kde-format
msgid "&IP address:"
msgstr "&IP 位址:"

#: edit.cpp:482
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"If your computer has a permanent internet\n"
"address, you must supply your IP address here."
msgstr ""
"如果您的電腦擁有固定的互聯網\n"
"位址，您必須在這裡提供 IP 位址。"

#: edit.cpp:493
#, kde-format
msgid "&Subnet mask:"
msgstr "子網絡遮罩(&S):"

#: edit.cpp:494
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<p>If your computer has a static Internet address,\n"
"you must supply a network mask here. In almost\n"
"all cases this netmask will be <b>255.255.255.0</b>,\n"
"but your mileage may vary.\n"
"\n"
"If unsure, contact your Internet Service Provider"
msgstr ""
"<p>如果您的電腦是使用固定的互聯網位\n"
"址，您必須在此提供網路遮罩。在絕大部份\n"
"情況下，這個網路遮罩是 <b>255.255.255.0</b>，\n"
"但是您的情況可能不同。\n"
"\n"
"如果無法確定，請洽詢您的互聯網服務提供者"

#: edit.cpp:509
#, kde-format
msgid "&Auto-configure hostname from this IP"
msgstr "自動從這個 IP 設定主機名稱(&A)"

#: edit.cpp:515
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<p>Whenever you connect, this reconfigures\n"
"your hostname to match the IP address you\n"
"got from the PPP server. This may be useful\n"
"if you need to use a protocol which depends\n"
"on this information, but it can also cause several\n"
"<a href=\"kppp-7.html#autohostname\">problems</a>.\n"
"\n"
"Do not enable this unless you really need it."
msgstr ""
"<p>每當您連線時，此選項會重新設定\n"
"主機名稱以配合您自 PPP 伺服器所\n"
"取得的 IP 位址。如果您需要使用到\n"
"以此種資訊為基礎的通訊協定，它可\n"
"能很有用處；但是它也可能造成一些\n"
"<a href=\"kppp-7.html#autohostname\">問題</a>。\n"
"\n"
"除非真有需要，否則請勿啟用它。"

#: edit.cpp:556
#, fuzzy, kde-format
#| msgid ""
#| "Selecting this option might cause some weird problems with the X-server "
#| "and applications while kppp is connected. Don't use it until you know "
#| "what you are doing!\n"
#| "For more information take a look at the handbook (or help) in the section "
#| "\"Frequently asked questions\"."
msgid ""
"Selecting this option might cause some weird problems with the X-server and "
"applications while kppp is connected. Do not use it unless you know what you "
"are doing.\n"
"For more information take a look at the handbook (or help) in the "
"\"Frequently asked questions\" section."
msgstr ""
"選擇這個選項可能會使 X 伺服器與應\n"
"用程式在 kppp 連線時發生一些奇怪的\n"
"問題。因此除非您知道您在做什麼，否則\n"
"請勿使用！\n"
"相關詳情可參閱手冊內容（或輔助說明）\n"
"中的「常見問題」章節。"

#: edit.cpp:563
#, kde-format
msgid "Warning"
msgstr ""

#: edit.cpp:609
#, kde-format
msgid "Domain &name:"
msgstr "網域名稱(&N):"

#: edit.cpp:616
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"If you enter a domain name here, this domain\n"
"name is used for your computer while you are\n"
"connected. When the connection is closed, the\n"
"original domain name of your computer is\n"
"restored.\n"
"\n"
"If you leave this field blank, no changes are\n"
"made to the domain name."
msgstr ""
"如果在這裡輸入網域名稱，當您連線時\n"
"您的電腦將使用它。當連線關閉時，\n"
"電腦原來的網域名稱則會還原。\n"
"\n"
"如果將這個欄位留空，網域\n"
"名稱將不會改變。"

#: edit.cpp:628
#, kde-format
msgid "C&onfiguration:"
msgstr "設定(&O):"

#: edit.cpp:636
#, kde-format
msgid "Automatic"
msgstr "自動"

#: edit.cpp:643
#, kde-format
msgid "Manual"
msgstr "手動"

#: edit.cpp:647
#, kde-format
msgid "DNS &IP address:"
msgstr "DNS &IP 位址:"

#: edit.cpp:660
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<p>Allows you to specify a new DNS server to be\n"
"used while you are connected. When the\n"
"connection is closed, this DNS entry will be\n"
"removed again.\n"
"\n"
"To add a DNS server, type in the IP address of\n"
"the DNS server here and click on <b>Add</b>"
msgstr ""
"<p>可供您指定連線時使用的新 \n"
"DNS 伺服器。當連線關閉時，\n"
"這個 DNS 項目將會被再次移除。\n"
"\n"
"若要新增 DNS 伺服器，請在此鍵入\n"
"DNS 伺服器的 IP 位址，並按下<b>新增</b>"

#: edit.cpp:673 edit.cpp:910 pppdargs.cpp:86
#, kde-format
msgid "&Add"
msgstr "新增(&A)"

#: edit.cpp:681
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Click this button to add the DNS server\n"
"specified in the field above. The entry\n"
"will then be added to the list below"
msgstr ""
"按下這個按鈕即可新增上述欄位\n"
"中所指定的 DNS 伺服器。該項目\n"
"會接著新增到下列清單中"

#: edit.cpp:692
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Click this button to remove the selected DNS\n"
"server entry from the list below"
msgstr ""
"按下這個按鈕可以移除下列清單中\n"
"選擇的 DNS 伺服器項目"

#: edit.cpp:695
#, kde-format
msgid "DNS address &list:"
msgstr "DNS 位址清單(&L):"

#: edit.cpp:705
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<p>This shows all defined DNS servers to use\n"
"while you are connected. Use the <b>Add</b> and\n"
"<b>Remove</b> buttons to modify the list"
msgstr ""
"<p>這個顯示連線後可供使用的所有\n"
"已定義 DNS 伺服器。請使用<b>新增</b>及\n"
"<b>移除</b>按鈕來修改清單"

#: edit.cpp:713
#, kde-format
msgid "&Disable existing DNS servers during connection"
msgstr "連線時關閉現有的 DNS 伺服器(&D)"

#: edit.cpp:718
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<p>When this option is selected, all DNS\n"
"servers specified in <tt>/etc/resolv.conf</tt> are\n"
"temporary disabled while the dialup connection\n"
"is established. After the connection is\n"
"closed, the servers will be re-enabled\n"
"\n"
"Typically, there is no reason to use this\n"
"option, but it may become useful under \n"
"some circumstances."
msgstr ""
"<p>選擇這個選項時，在 <tt>/etc/resolv.conf</tt>\n"
"中指定的所有 DNS 伺服器會\n"
"在建立撥號連線時被暫時\n"
"停用。待連線關閉後，會\n"
"重新使用這些伺服器\n"
"\n"
"一般來說，並無必要使用此\n"
"選項，但在某些情況下它可能\n"
"極有用處。"

#: edit.cpp:816
#, kde-format
msgid "Default gateway"
msgstr "預設閘道"

#: edit.cpp:819
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"This makes the PPP peer computer (the computer\n"
"you are connected to with your modem) to act as\n"
"a gateway. Your computer will send all packets not\n"
"going to a computer inside your local net to this\n"
"computer, which will route these packets.\n"
"\n"
"This is the default for most ISPs, so you should\n"
"probably leave this option on."
msgstr ""
"此選項會使 PPP 對等電腦（您透過\n"
"數據機所連接的電腦）作為閘道。\n"
"您的電腦會將不是送往您區域網絡的\n"
"所有封包傳送至該電腦，由其導送\n"
"這些封包。\n"
"\n"
"對大部份 ISP 這是預設值，因此您應該\n"
"讓此選項保持開啟"

#: edit.cpp:830
#, kde-format
msgid "Static gateway"
msgstr "靜態閘道"

#: edit.cpp:833
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<p>Allows you to specify which computer you want\n"
"to use as gateway (see <i>Default Gateway</i> above)"
msgstr ""
"<p>可供您指定要以哪部電腦作為\n"
"閘道（請參閱上述的<i>預設閘道</i>）"

#: edit.cpp:838
#, kde-format
msgid "Gateway &IP address:"
msgstr "閘道 &IP 位址:"

#: edit.cpp:844
#, kde-format
msgid "&Assign the default route to this gateway"
msgstr "將預設路由指派至這個閘道(&A)"

#: edit.cpp:847
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"If this option is enabled, all packets not\n"
"going to the local net are routed through\n"
"the PPP connection.\n"
"\n"
"Normally, you should turn this on"
msgstr ""
"如果啟動這個選項，不是送往區域\n"
"網絡的所有封包將透過 PPP 連線來\n"
"導送。\n"
"\n"
"一般而言，您應加以開啟"

#: edit.cpp:912
#, fuzzy, kde-format
msgid "&Insert"
msgstr "回答"

#: edit.cpp:1226
#, kde-format
msgid "Add Phone Number"
msgstr "新增電話號碼"

#: edit.cpp:1239
#, kde-format
msgid "Enter a phone number:"
msgstr "輸入電話號碼:"

#: general.cpp:67
#, kde-format
msgid "pppd version:"
msgstr "pppd 版本:"

#: general.cpp:77
#, kde-format
msgid "pppd &timeout:"
msgstr "pppd 逾時(&T):"

#: general.cpp:80 general.cpp:402 general.cpp:498
#, kde-format
msgid " sec"
msgstr " 秒"

#: general.cpp:84
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<i>kppp</i> will wait this number of seconds\n"
"to see if a PPP connection is established.\n"
"If no connection is made in this time frame,\n"
"<i>kppp</i> will give up and kill pppd."
msgstr ""
"<i>kppp</i> 將等候所述秒數\n"
"以查看是否已建立 PPP 連線。\n"
"如果並未在這個時限內建立連線，\n"
"<i>kppp</i> 將放棄並清除 pppd。"

#: general.cpp:93
#, kde-format
msgid "Doc&k into panel on connect"
msgstr "連線時嵌入至面板(&K)"

#: general.cpp:95
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<p>After a connection is established, the\n"
"window is minimized and a small icon\n"
"in the KDE panel represents this window.\n"
"\n"
"Clicking on this icon will restore the\n"
"window to its original location and\n"
"size."
msgstr ""
"<p>待建立連線後，視窗即\n"
"最小化並會有代表此視窗的\n"
"小圖示顯示在 KDE 面板中。\n"
"\n"
"按下這個圖示即可將視窗\n"
"恢復成原來位置與大小。"

#: general.cpp:108
#, kde-format
msgid "A&utomatic redial on disconnect"
msgstr "斷線時自動重撥(&U)"

#: general.cpp:114
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<p>When a connection is established and\n"
"it somehow gets disconnected, <i>kppp</i>\n"
"will try to reconnect to the same account.\n"
"\n"
"See <a href=\"#redial\">here</a> for more on this topic."
msgstr ""
"<p>建立連線後若因某種\n"
"原因導致斷線，<i>kppp</i>\n"
"將試著重新連接同一帳號。\n"
"\n"
"有關這個主題的詳細資訊，請參閱<a href=\"#redial\">這裡</a>。"

#: general.cpp:120
#, kde-format
msgid "Automatic redial on NO &CARRIER"
msgstr "沒有載波時自動重撥(&C)"

#: general.cpp:126
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<p>When dialing if modem returns NO CARRIER\n"
"the program will make a new attempt to redial\n"
"instead of waiting for user to click <CANCEL>\n"
"button."
msgstr ""
"<p>當撥號時，如數據機傳回「沒有載波」訊號，\n"
"程式將試著重撥，而不是等待使用者按<取消>鍵。"

#: general.cpp:131
#, kde-format
msgid "&Show clock on caption"
msgstr "於標題顯示時鐘(&S)"

#: general.cpp:137
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"When this option is checked, the window\n"
"title shows the time since a connection\n"
"was established. Very useful, so you \n"
"should turn this on"
msgstr ""
"核取這個選項時，視窗\n"
"標題會顯示建立連線後\n"
"經過的時間。它非常有用，\n"
"因此請開啟"

#: general.cpp:142
#, kde-format
msgid "Disco&nnect on X server shutdown"
msgstr "於 X 伺服器關閉時斷線(&N)"

#: general.cpp:148
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<p>Checking this option will close any\n"
"open connection when the X-server is\n"
"shut down. You should enable this option\n"
"unless you know what you are doing.\n"
"\n"
"See <a href=\"#disxserver\">here</a> for more on this."
msgstr ""
"<p>核取這個選項會在 X 伺服器關閉\n"
"時將任何已建立的連線予以\n"
"關閉。除非您真正了解所要達成\n"
"的目的，否則您不應該啟用它。\n"
"\n"
"相關詳情請參閱<a href=\"#disxserver\">這裡</a>。"

#: general.cpp:155
#, kde-format
msgid "&Quit on disconnect"
msgstr "切斷連線時離開(&Q)"

#: general.cpp:161
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"When this option is turned on, <i>kppp</i>\n"
"will be closed when you disconnect"
msgstr ""
"開啟這個選項時，<i>kppp</i>\n"
"將會在您斷線時關閉"

#: general.cpp:164
#, kde-format
msgid "Minimi&ze window on connect"
msgstr "連線時將視窗最小化(&Z)"

#: general.cpp:170
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Iconifies <i>kppp</i>'s window when a\n"
"connection is established"
msgstr ""
"建立連線後將 <i>kppp</i> 視窗\n"
"圖示化"

#: general.cpp:228
#, kde-format
msgid "Modem &name:"
msgstr "數據機名稱(&N):"

#: general.cpp:236
#, kde-format
msgid "Type in a unique name for this modem"
msgstr "輸入數據機的唯一名稱"

#: general.cpp:241
#, kde-format
msgid "Modem de&vice:"
msgstr "數據機裝置(&V):"

#: general.cpp:261
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"This specifies the serial port your modem is attached \n"
"to. On Linux/x86, typically this is either /dev/ttyS0 \n"
"(COM1 under DOS) or /dev/ttyS1 (COM2 under DOS).\n"
"\n"
"If you have an internal ISDN card with AT command\n"
"emulation (most cards under Linux support this), you\n"
"should select one of the /dev/ttyIx devices."
msgstr ""
"指定數據機所接用的序列埠。\n"
"在 Linux/x86 上，通常是 /dev/ttyS0 \n"
"(DOS 下的 COM1)或 /dev/ttyS1 (DOS 下的 COM2)。\n"
"\n"
"如果您擁有具備 AT 指令模擬功能的 ISDN \n"
"介面卡（大多數介面卡 Linux 皆支援此功能），\n"
"你應選擇 /dev/ttyIx 裝置之一。"

#: general.cpp:273
#, kde-format
msgid "&Flow control:"
msgstr "流量控制(&F):"

#: general.cpp:280
#, kde-format
msgid "Software [XON/XOFF]"
msgstr "軟件 [XON/XOFF]"

#: general.cpp:291
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<p>Specifies how the serial port and modem\n"
"communicate. You should not change this unless\n"
"you know what you are doing.\n"
"\n"
"<b>Default</b>: CRTSCTS"
msgstr ""
"<p>指定序列埠與數據機的通訊\n"
"方式。除非您真正了解所要達成\n"
"的目的，否則請勿加以變更。\n"
"\n"
"<b>預設值</b>： CRTSCTS"

#: general.cpp:300
#, kde-format
msgid "&Line termination:"
msgstr "線路終端(&L):"

#: general.cpp:311
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<p>Specifies how AT commands are sent to your\n"
"modem. Most modems will work fine with the\n"
"default <i>CR/LF</i>. If your modem does not react\n"
"to the init string, you should try different\n"
"settings here\n"
"\n"
"<b>Default</b>: CR/LF"
msgstr ""
"<p>指定 AT 命令送達數據機的\n"
"方式。大部分的數據機皆可正常使用\n"
"預設值 <i>CR/LF</i>。如果您的數據機對\n"
"起始字串並無反應，請在此試用不同的\n"
"設定值\n"
"\n"
"<b>預設值</b>： CR/LF"

#: general.cpp:322
#, kde-format
msgid "Co&nnection speed:"
msgstr "連線速度(&N):"

#: general.cpp:361
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Specifies the speed your modem and the serial\n"
"port talk to each other. You should begin with\n"
"at least 115200 bits/sec (or more if you know\n"
"that your serial port supports higher speeds).\n"
"If you have connection problems, try to reduce\n"
"this value."
msgstr ""
"指定數據機與序列埠彼此通訊\n"
"的速度。開始時應使用至少 \n"
"115200 位元/秒（或如您知道您的序列埠支援更高的速度，指定\n"
"大一些的數字）。如果連線有問題，\n"
"試著調低這個值。"

#: general.cpp:379
#, kde-format
msgid "&Use lock file"
msgstr "使用鎖定檔案(&U)"

#: general.cpp:387
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<p>To prevent other programs from accessing the\n"
"modem while a connection is established, a\n"
"file can be created to indicate that the modem\n"
"is in use. On Linux an example file would be\n"
"<tt>/var/lock/LCK..ttyS1</tt>\n"
"Here you can select whether this locking will\n"
"be done.\n"
"\n"
"<b>Default</b>: On"
msgstr ""
"<p>為避免其他程式在建立\n"
"連線後存取數據機，您可以\n"
"建立一檔案來指明該數據機\n"
"正被使用。例如在 Linux 下\n"
"檔案可能為 <tt>/var/lock/LCK..ttyS1</tt>\n"
"您可以在此選擇是否要執行\n"
"此種鎖定。\n"
"\n"
"<b>預設值</b>： 開啟"

#: general.cpp:400
#, kde-format
msgid "Modem &timeout:"
msgstr "數據機逾時(&T):"

#: general.cpp:408
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"This specifies how long <i>kppp</i> waits for a\n"
"<i>CONNECT</i> response from your modem. The\n"
"recommended value is 30 seconds."
msgstr ""
"指定 <i>kppp</i> 應在多長的時間內\n"
"等候數據機做出 <i>CONNECT</i> 回應。\n"
"建議值為 30 秒。"

#: general.cpp:481
#, kde-format
msgid "&Wait for dial tone before dialing"
msgstr "撥號前先等待撥號音(&W)"

#: general.cpp:486
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<p>Normally the modem waits for a dial tone\n"
"from your phone line, indicating that it can\n"
"start to dial a number. If your modem does not\n"
"recognize this sound, or your local phone system\n"
"does not emit such a tone, uncheck this option\n"
"\n"
"<b>Default:</b>: On"
msgstr ""
"<p>一般來說，數據機會在撥號前先等待撥號音，\n"
"以確認可以開始撥號。若是您的數據機無法辨別撥\n"
"號音，或者您的本地電話系統並不發出這樣的音頻，\n"
"請取消這個選項\n"
"\n"
"<b>預設：</b>： 開啟"

#: general.cpp:495
#, kde-format
msgid "B&usy wait:"
msgstr "忙線等候(&U):"

#: general.cpp:503
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Specifies the number of seconds to wait before\n"
"redial if all dialed numbers are busy. This is\n"
"necessary because some modems get stuck if the\n"
"same number is busy too often.\n"
"\n"
"The default is 0 seconds, you should not change\n"
"this unless you need to."
msgstr ""
"指定當忙線時應先等候多少秒數\n"
"才進行重撥。這個選項屬必要\n"
"性質，因為有些數據機遇到經常\n"
"忙線的狀況時會進退不得。\n"
"\n"
"預設值為 0 秒鐘，但除非您有需要\n"
"否則請勿變更。"

#: general.cpp:516
#, kde-format
msgid "Modem &volume:"
msgstr "數據機音量(&V):"

#: general.cpp:531
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Most modems have a speaker which makes\n"
"a lot of noise when dialing. Here you can\n"
"either turn this completely off or select a\n"
"lower volume.\n"
"\n"
"If this does not work for your modem,\n"
"you must modify the modem volume command."
msgstr ""
"大部份數據機擁有揚聲器，在撥接時\n"
"會發出大量噪音。您可以在這裡將其\n"
"完全關閉或選擇較低的音量。\n"
"\n"
"如果此選項對數據機並無作用，\n"
"您即必須修改數據機音量指令。"

#: general.cpp:545
#, kde-format
msgid "Modem asserts CD line"
msgstr "數據機佔用 CD 線路"

#: general.cpp:553
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"This controls how <i>kppp</i> detects that the modem\n"
"is not responding. Unless you are having\n"
"problems with this, do not modify this setting.\n"
"\n"
"<b>Default</b>: Off"
msgstr ""
"可控制 <i>kppp</i> 如何偵測數據機\n"
"並無回應。除非發生了這個問題，\n"
"否則請勿修改此設定。\n"
"\n"
"<b>預設值</b>： 關閉"

#: general.cpp:560
#, kde-format
msgid "Mod&em Commands..."
msgstr "數據機指令(&E)..."

#: general.cpp:562
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Allows you to change the AT command for\n"
"your modem."
msgstr ""
"可用來變更數據機的\n"
"AT 指令。"

#: general.cpp:565
#, kde-format
msgid "&Query Modem..."
msgstr "查詢數據機(&Q)..."

#: general.cpp:567
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Most modems support the ATI command set to\n"
"find out vendor and revision of your modem.\n"
"\n"
"Press this button to query your modem for\n"
"this information. It can be useful to help\n"
"you set up the modem"
msgstr ""
"大部份數據機皆支援 ATI 指令集，可供\n"
"查明數據機的製造廠商及版本。\n"
"\n"
"按下此按鈕以查詢數據機的相關\n"
"資訊。此類資訊對設定數據機\n"
"很有幫助"

#: general.cpp:574
#, kde-format
msgid "&Terminal..."
msgstr "終端機(&T)..."

#: general.cpp:576
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Opens the built-in terminal program. You\n"
"can use this if you want to play around\n"
"with your modem's AT command set"
msgstr ""
"開啟內建的終端機程式。您\n"
"可以使用這個選項來操控數\n"
"據機的 AT 指令集"

#: general.cpp:651
#, kde-format
msgid "&Enable throughput graph"
msgstr "啟用流量圖(&E)"

#: general.cpp:655
#, kde-format
