#: kpppwidget.cpp:121
#, kde-format
msgid "C&onnect to: "
msgstr "連線至(&O): "

#: kpppwidget.cpp:132
#, kde-format
msgid "Use &modem: "
msgstr "使用數據機(&M):"

#: kpppwidget.cpp:143
#, kde-format
msgid "&Login ID:"
msgstr "登入 ID (&L):"

#: kpppwidget.cpp:152
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<p>Type in the username that you got from your\n"
"ISP. This is especially important for PAP\n"
"and CHAP. You may omit this when you use\n"
"terminal-based or script-based authentication.\n"
"\n"
"<b>Important</b>: case is important here:\n"
"<i>myusername</i> is not the same as <i>MyUserName</i>."
msgstr ""
"<p>請鍵入您的 ISP 所提供的使用者名稱。\n"
"此點對 PAP 與 CHAP 尤其重要。\n"
"當您使用終端機式或 script 式\n"
"認證時可以略過這個選項。\n"
"\n"
"<b>重要事項</b>： 此處須區分大小寫：\n"
"<i>myusername</i> 與 <i>MyUserName</i> 是不同的！"

#: kpppwidget.cpp:163
#, kde-format
msgid "&Password:"
msgstr "密碼(&P):"

#: kpppwidget.cpp:173
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<p>Type in the password that you got from your\n"
"ISP. This is especially important for PAP\n"
"and CHAP. You may omit this when you use\n"
"terminal-based or script-based authentication.\n"
"\n"
"<b>Important</b>: case is important here:\n"
"<i>mypassword</i> is not the same as <i>MyPassword</i>."
msgstr ""
"<p>請鍵入您的 ISP 所提供的密碼。\n"
"此點對 PAP 與 CHAP 尤其重要。\n"
"當您使用終端機式或 script 式\n"
"認證時可以略過這個選項。\n"
"\n"
"<b>重要事項</b>： 此處須區分大小寫：\n"
"<i>mypassword</i> 與 <i>MyPassword</i> 是不同的！"

#: kpppwidget.cpp:189
#, kde-format
msgid "Show lo&g window"
msgstr "顯示記錄視窗(&G)"

#: kpppwidget.cpp:196
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<p>This controls whether a log window is shown.\n"
"A log window shows the communication between\n"
"<i>kppp</i> and your modem. This will help you\n"
"in tracking down problems.\n"
"\n"
"Turn it off if <i>kppp</i> routinely connects without\n"
"problems"
msgstr ""
"<p>此選項可控制是否顯示記錄視窗。\n"
"記錄視窗會顯示 <i>kppp</i> 與您的\n"
"數據機之間的通訊過程。因此可協助\n"
"您追查問題。\n"
"\n"
"如果 <i>kppp</i> 可按時連線而沒有任何\n"
"問題，即可關閉此選項"

